" id="41d5da5d-fb97-3c4a-935f-6cf2896834ff_desktop"></div></div></section><section class="mt-module-gap" id="module-coview"><div class="mb-[110px]" id="recommended-article-stream"><div class="flex flex-row flex-nowrap items-center mb-3"><div class="bg-brand-yahoo-purple mr-2 h-[20px] w-[8px] flex-none rounded-xs block"></div><h2 class="text-batcave flex-auto font-bold text-px20">其他人也在看</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap"><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/DFE1FA18FC06B47B84144006AC299B129D312F973ECC421C0AC48D2CC0C50AF5/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F77ae50c410c7cf202b416295497808c4"/><img alt="今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/130DAEE15FD7ED87800567D80752A9A5BF38AA7ED13E441C9F983846B89ECFF0/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F77ae50c410c7cf202b416295497808c4"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;dd224446-5652-3714-b3d4-9c1437529d8c&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:1,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:1;ct:story;g:dd224446-5652-3714-b3d4-9c1437529d8c;slk:今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC2%E4%BE%8B-%E6%96%B0%E5%8C%97%E4%B9%9F%E7%88%86%E6%BC%A2%E4%BB%96%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92-7%E6%97%AC%E7%94%B7-%E6%B2%92%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%B8%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%AD%E9%8F%A2-%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E6%BA%90%E5%BE%85%E9%87%90%E6%B8%85-100600181.html">今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">繼台北市1月出現今年首例漢他病毒症候群病例後，新北市1名70多歲男性近期因發燒、肌肉痛、腸胃不適等症狀，就醫採檢確診成第2例。目前個案已出院，感染源調查中。衛福部疾管署副署長曾淑慧表示，針對有個案發生地點，疾管署已督導台北市和新北市衛生局與環保局共同合作，加強個案活動地環境清潔工作。（記者：簡浩正）</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/36910269B5B04AC1E6997BF012D13204023AF5238216DE9F8835FDADC95C3095/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn_finance_535%2F8b88f98c4faad2cfca973f6dd87a678f"/><img alt="她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/730A80F26FCABF7DA0E5E09824931DABCF335FA2CC90E89A17B1E38EAA3B0854/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn_finance_535%2F8b88f98c4faad2cfca973f6dd87a678f"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;6f617e3d-776b-3336-b7f1-9bf24b7821b5&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:3,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:3;ct:story;g:6f617e3d-776b-3336-b7f1-9bf24b7821b5;slk:她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E5%A5%B9%E5%85%A5%E5%B8%824%E5%B9%B4-40%E8%90%AC%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%91%E8%B3%A0%E5%88%B0%E5%89%A917%E8%90%AC-%E5%85%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9B%9D%E7%BF%BB%E8%BA%AB%E5%AF%86%E6%8A%80-095910090.html">她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">財經中心／王妤倢報導近期台積電股價一路狂飆，讓不少投資人笑開懷，但在這波大多頭行情中，卻有人反向慘賠。一名女網友發文哀號，自己接觸股票約3、4年，投入本金40萬元，沒想到如今帳面僅剩約17萬元，整整慘虧23萬元。貼文曝光後，引發大批網友驚呼：「現在大多頭無腦買都能賺，你怎麼有辦法賠23萬？」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視財經網 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FD98955C69EFB6F38055EA96733503EE103F58183B67C1F2F93ABA70AABC2464/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8644fbf53721b9931d0ea584245bbe32"/><img alt="台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E466A1DB8FBDB04667E793C3C6643C911D990494BA7F0E213DC0C2A3E28F9D61/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8644fbf53721b9931d0ea584245bbe32"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;ffb262b0-afd7-373a-b9e4-1cea3a04c3d0&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:4,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:4;ct:story;g:ffb262b0-afd7-373a-b9e4-1cea3a04c3d0;slk:台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E9%BC%A0%E6%82%A3%E7%87%92-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%8A%95%E8%97%A5%E6%89%AF%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%81%AD%E6%89%B9-%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E9%81%B8%E4%BD%A0%E5%B9%B9%E5%98%9B-100053130.html">台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">即時中心／林韋慈報導台北市近期頻爆鼠患問題，民進黨台北市議員林亮君日前發現市府竟直接將老鼠藥投放在公園，擔心小朋友與寵物誤食。對此，台北市長蔣萬安今（2）日回應表示，環境用藥是中央核可的。台灣基進台北市議員候選人吳欣岱痛批，蔣萬安凡事都要推給中央，「市民選你當市長到底要做什麼？」並呼籲蔣萬安：「把力氣用在真正能解決問題的地方，而不是一直找藉口。」</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>23<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/736D006E44DD0FF6C00C90E5ED442EC7F92B3CBD70AA046D103B6260770E7BFF/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fd29405be303c52114b9a30d48cdeb5cc"/><img alt="法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B5701B9B8D6E1E8305D00A2B06D95E37BF20184B6BFCD20CF651E002DD670D6D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fd29405be303c52114b9a30d48cdeb5cc"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;a73ea9f3-4767-3b75-8704-32a2cb99a526&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:5,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:5;ct:story;g:a73ea9f3-4767-3b75-8704-32a2cb99a526;slk:法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A0%85%E6%8B%92%E6%94%B6%E6%8A%BC-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E7%A0%B8%E5%BA%97%E5%A5%B3%E6%89%BE%E6%AA%A2%E5%AF%9F%E5%AE%98%E5%A0%B1%E5%88%B0%E6%83%B9%E8%AD%B0-%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-055910775.html">法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">即時中心／林韋慈報導高雄一名李姓女子酒後在超商涉嫌暴力毆打女店員，將店員打到頭破血流，遭檢方依傷害罪起訴後，卻因交保一事引發高雄地檢署的不滿。法院數度裁定羈押駁回，雄檢不滿提抗告，最終卻裁定女子要每週找檢察官報到，引起法界譁然。高雄地方法院陳姓法官今（2）日下午裁定李女無需羈押，但調整交保條件，改要求她每週三到法院報到。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 3 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="str