ave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;dd224446-5652-3714-b3d4-9c1437529d8c&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:1,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:1;ct:story;g:dd224446-5652-3714-b3d4-9c1437529d8c;slk:今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC2%E4%BE%8B-%E6%96%B0%E5%8C%97%E4%B9%9F%E7%88%86%E6%BC%A2%E4%BB%96%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92-7%E6%97%AC%E7%94%B7-%E6%B2%92%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%B8%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%AD%E9%8F%A2-%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E6%BA%90%E5%BE%85%E9%87%90%E6%B8%85-100600181.html">今年第2例！新北也爆漢他病毒　7旬男「沒接觸老鼠也中鏢」感染源待釐清</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">繼台北市1月出現今年首例漢他病毒症候群病例後，新北市1名70多歲男性近期因發燒、肌肉痛、腸胃不適等症狀，就醫採檢確診成第2例。目前個案已出院，感染源調查中。衛福部疾管署副署長曾淑慧表示，針對有個案發生地點，疾管署已督導台北市和新北市衛生局與環保局共同合作，加強個案活動地環境清潔工作。（記者：簡浩正）</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/36910269B5B04AC1E6997BF012D13204023AF5238216DE9F8835FDADC95C3095/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn_finance_535%2F8b88f98c4faad2cfca973f6dd87a678f"/><img alt="她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/730A80F26FCABF7DA0E5E09824931DABCF335FA2CC90E89A17B1E38EAA3B0854/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn_finance_535%2F8b88f98c4faad2cfca973f6dd87a678f"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;6f617e3d-776b-3336-b7f1-9bf24b7821b5&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:3,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:3;ct:story;g:6f617e3d-776b-3336-b7f1-9bf24b7821b5;slk:她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E5%A5%B9%E5%85%A5%E5%B8%824%E5%B9%B4-40%E8%90%AC%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%91%E8%B3%A0%E5%88%B0%E5%89%A917%E8%90%AC-%E5%85%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9B%9D%E7%BF%BB%E8%BA%AB%E5%AF%86%E6%8A%80-095910090.html">她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">財經中心／王妤倢報導近期台積電股價一路狂飆，讓不少投資人笑開懷，但在這波大多頭行情中，卻有人反向慘賠。一名女網友發文哀號，自己接觸股票約3、4年，投入本金40萬元，沒想到如今帳面僅剩約17萬元，整整慘虧23萬元。貼文曝光後，引發大批網友驚呼：「現在大多頭無腦買都能賺，你怎麼有辦法賠23萬？」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視財經網 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A498ED682ABB839DB6EF6B153C23D3FB0E187DC1BBC77F22417C0F74CA73D618/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fc24d6dc60bcebfdced8b77bed88c6799"/><img alt="女山友遇山難滑落6米邊坡！她「耳漏鼻漏」意識模糊…急派黑鷹救援送醫" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F20B547F0B7A2453C0B4BACC98D7AE90BB8D3F4BA554375EC6875AFA67558048/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fc24d6dc60bcebfdced8b77bed88c6799"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;553fca5e-cdfe-314b-98f7-81f971f92ed1&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:4,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;女山友遇山難滑落6米邊坡！她「耳漏鼻漏」意識模糊…急派黑鷹救援送醫&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:4;ct:story;g:553fca5e-cdfe-314b-98f7-81f971f92ed1;slk:女山友遇山難滑落6米邊坡！她「耳漏鼻漏」意識模糊…急派黑鷹救援送醫;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="女山友遇山難滑落6米邊坡！她「耳漏鼻漏」意識模糊…急派黑鷹救援送醫" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%B3%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%8B%E9%81%87%E5%B1%B1%E9%9B%A3%E6%BB%91%E8%90%BD6%E7%B1%B3%E9%82%8A%E5%9D%A1-%E5%A5%B9-%E8%80%B3%E6%BC%8F%E9%BC%BB%E6%BC%8F-%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E6%A8%A1%E7%B3%8A-%E6%80%A5%E6%B4%BE%E9%BB%91%E9%B7%B9%E6%95%91%E6%8F%B4%E9%80%81%E9%86%AB-063100252.html">女山友遇山難滑落6米邊坡！她「耳漏鼻漏」意識模糊…急派黑鷹救援送醫</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">屏東縣泰武鄉北大武登山口今天（2日）清晨發生山難，55歲劉姓女山友，不慎滑落約6公尺深的邊坡，警消獲報到場，考量劉女意識模糊，有耳漏鼻漏症狀，為把握救援時機，申請空中勤務總隊直昇機吊掛救援，並順利將人運出山區，順利送醫。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 5 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/736D006E44DD0FF6C00C90E5ED442EC7F92B3CBD70AA046D103B6260770E7BFF/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fd29405be303c52114b9a30d48cdeb5cc"/><img alt="法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B5701B9B8D6E1E8305D00A2B06D95E37BF20184B6BFCD20CF651E002DD670D6D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fd29405be303c52114b9a30d48cdeb5cc"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;a73ea9f3-4767-3b75-8704-32a2cb99a526&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:5,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:5;ct:story;g:a73ea9f3-4767-3b75-8704-32a2cb99a526;slk:法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A0%85%E6%8B%92%E6%94%B6%E6%8A%BC-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E7%A0%B8%E5%BA%97%E5%A5%B3%E6%89%BE%E6%AA%A2%E5%AF%9F%E5%AE%98%E5%A0%B1%E5%88%B0%E6%83%B9%E8%AD%B0-%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-055910775.html">法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">即時中心／林韋慈報導高雄一名李姓女子酒後在超商涉嫌暴力毆打女店員，將店員打到頭破血流，遭檢方依傷害罪起訴後，卻因交保一事引發高雄地檢署的不滿。法院數度裁定羈押駁回，雄檢不滿提抗告，最終卻裁定女子要每週找檢察官報到，引起法界譁然。高雄地方法院陳姓法官今（2）日下午裁定李女無需羈押，但調整交保條件，改要求她每週三到法院報到。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 3 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FD98955C69EFB6F38055EA96733503EE103F58183B67C1F2F93ABA70AABC2464/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8644fbf53721b9931d0ea584245bbe32"/><img alt="台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E466A1DB8FBDB04667E793C3C6643C911D990494BA7F0E213DC0C2A3E28F9D61/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8644fbf53721b9931d0ea584245bbe32"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;ffb262b0-afd7-373a-b9e4-1cea3a04c3d0&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:7,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:7;ct:story;g:ffb262b0-afd7-373a-b9e4-1cea3a04c3d0;slk:台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E9%BC%A0%E6%82%A3%E7%87%92-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%8A%95%E8%97%A5%E6%89%AF%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%81%AD%E6%89%B9-%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E9%81%B8%E4%BD%A0%E5%B9%B9%E5%98%9B-100053130.html">台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">即時中心／林韋慈報導台北市近期頻爆鼠患問題，民進黨台北市議員林亮君日前發現市府竟直接將老鼠藥投放在公園，擔心小朋友與寵物誤食。對此，台北市長蔣萬安今（2）日回應表示，環境用藥是中央核可的。台灣基進台北市議員候選人吳欣岱痛批，蔣萬安凡事都要推給中央，「市民選你當市長到底要做什麼？」並呼籲蔣萬安：「把力氣用在真正能解決問題的地方，而不是一直找藉口。」</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>24<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C50CED7D366731A201BE4824933E64E089E31C49EB0972A62E7A43DC43D95C7D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F2bb52e8dcee430d35866a396dab2d648"/><img alt="女大生怕上香被打⋯赴靈堂先打110？轄區警力派10人部署　六分局回應了" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8555CEA451B36AD8D956FE1E0E95F3C4B5CC31249E93B3EC4F2423D493424999/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F2bb52e8dcee430d35866a396dab2d648"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;1fe7957c-6fb5-3ebd-9b9c-96f7e03cd1a9&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:8,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;女大生怕上香被打⋯赴靈堂先打110？轄區警力派10人部署　六分局回應了&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:8;ct:story;g:1fe7957c-6fb5-3ebd-9b9c-96f7e03cd1a9;slk:女大生怕上香被打⋯赴靈堂先打110？轄區警力派10人部署　六分局回應了;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="女大生怕上香被打⋯赴靈堂先打110？轄區警力派10人部署　六分局回應了" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%B3%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%80%95%E4%B8%8A%E9%A6%99%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%93-%E8%B5%B4%E9%9D%88%E5%A0%82%E5%85%88%E6%89%93110-%E8%BD%84%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%A6%E5%8A%9B%E6%B4%BE10%E4%BA%BA%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-%E5%85%AD%E5%88%86%E5%B1%80%E5%9B%9E%E6%87%89%E4%BA%86-104800637.html">女大生怕上香被打⋯赴靈堂先打110？轄區警力派10人部署　六分局回應了</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">台南市警局育平派出所女警鄭詠心，4月28日騎機車外出時遭戴姓女大生追撞，人倒下後慘遭閃避不及的遊覽車輾斃，年輕生命就此停格。戴姓女大生在案發後第五天，才終於在今（2)日現身靈堂，傳出她在出發前擔心自己人身安全，撥打110報案，轄區六分局才派員部署，對此，台南市警局第六分局表示，110報案內容警方有保護之責，任何人報案均一視同仁，警方有保密之責任與義務，不過，早於1日晚間掌握情資，因而在靈堂部署10</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F7D24E81383ADADB261DCD0FD5EAA95FEF72D84079DB1DC57ADF9D165C7AAFAC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F4b3881c34e0b20cdefc99009d2b2a359"/><img alt="香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4FF34AA6E34A5BC90ED6863CCE8810C45F260D5C4A04F1D19D66B14C5E407C45/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F4b3881c34e0b20cdefc99009d2b2a359"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;99ee4631-d68b-3ebc-a9a8-c47215334884&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:9,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:9;ct:story;g:99ee4631-d68b-3ebc-a9a8-c47215334884;slk:香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%99%E8%8F%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%85%AE%E6%89%8D%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7-%E9%80%99%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-%E6%9C%80%E5%82%B7-%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E7%B4%A0%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%89-%E5%8D%8A-090141087.html">香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">香菇含有豐富的膳食纖維與香菇嘌呤等營養成分，具有代謝調節作用。不過烹調方式的選擇將大幅影響其營養價值。營養師老辜在臉書粉專分析4種常見烹調方式，其中水煮對香菇營養的破壞最為嚴重，多醣含量最高可下降約66％，多酚流失也可能超過一半，而烘烤則能最大化香菇的抗氧化能力。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8FFCB0F854DFCB4A9EA9A211C0C6C12958B54A15A7947F0BDEA3E110411A8537/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fudn.com%2Fef0813a53556c976eecff0bd7ed28a04"/><img alt="吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/769EA5E786E5804832E2B64DDED41D6FDC29714226385BAFCB6C2783E3D482B2/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fudn.com%2Fef0813a53556c976eecff0bd7ed28a04"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;77cefb6f-9479-33ac-91cf-2228c130384e&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:11,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:11;ct:story;g:77cefb6f-9479-33ac-91cf-2228c130384e;slk:吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%90%9E85%E9%A1%86%E6%AF%92%E8%86%A0%E5%9B%8A%E9%97%96%E9%97%9C-%E5%8C%88%E7%89%99%E5%88%A9%E7%94%B7%E7%82%BA%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E7%BE%8E%E9%87%91%E7%95%B6%E4%BA%BA%E9%AB%94%E9%81%8B%E6%AF%92%E6%A9%9F-053732386.html">吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">高雄小港機場查獲一名匈牙利籍男子為賺取約1萬美元報酬，鋌而走險擔任「人體運毒機」，在柬埔寨吞下高達85顆海洛因膠囊後，搭機闖關，檢警在他體內起出大量毒品，高雄地院審結，考量該男僅為運毒集團底層，且毒品未流入市面，雖運輸一級毒品面臨死刑或無期徒刑重罪，法官兩次減刑後，輕判其有期徒刑8年6月，執行完畢驅逐出境。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">聯合新聞網 ・ 6 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>12<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3FA0317FEDF3F3CDE2308B0E3DEDB6C813B2D4DECF7A98B6F6C95D41C50EA096/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F37e36492d8e0c93c6ef4ca98b7cb3c18"/><img alt="45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6676B4840A8F492F64AB31FBE8DE34584D2FB07952EC16A771169A7EE063D9A7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F37e36492d8e0c93c6ef4ca98b7cb3c18"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;c32f64ad-cf1e-35fe-a38b-3a7e3e6a040a&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:12,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:12;ct:story;g:c32f64ad-cf1e-35fe-a38b-3a7e3e6a040a;slk:45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/45%E6%AD%B2%E7%AB%B9%E7%A7%91%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%AB%E8%A1%80%E4%BE%BF%E6%98%8F%E5%80%92%EF%BC%81%E7%AB%9F%E7%BD%B9%E9%A3%9F%E9%81%93%E7%99%8C-%E9%86%AB%E6%8F%AD%E4%BA%9E%E6%B4%B2%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%8C1%E9%AB%94%E8%B3%AA%E3%80%8D%E6%98%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%8B%9B-030800757.html">45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">酒精是食道癌的重要風險因子之一，亞洲人更需提高警覺。胸腔外科醫師謝義山分享，一名45歲竹科工程師因出現大量血便而送醫，檢查確診為食道癌。醫師提醒，亞洲族群常見酒精代謝基因缺陷，飲酒易增加罹患食道癌的風險，因此除了應適量飲酒外，更應定期做健檢。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 8 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>5<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A93621947AF68917B64909842B845926429C242F973E47CB31A207896C4E037F/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2Fea8e934e0938a472fc7ebad730be9208"/><img alt="范姜彥豐談粿王「至今未親自道歉」　面對控訴毫不擔憂：他們沒招了" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E7C9908CDA7D15BC42013E1D40FFC2BB2250273FEB7093A09B3E135DFD76C0FC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2Fea8e934e0938a472fc7ebad730be9208"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;042fe5d4-9f93-3947-adcb-1f3182d855a7&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:13,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;范姜彥豐談粿王「至今未親自道歉」　面對控訴毫不擔憂：他們沒招了&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:13;ct:story;g:042fe5d4-9f93-3947-adcb-1f3182d855a7;slk:范姜彥豐談粿王「至今未親自道歉」　面對控訴毫不擔憂：他們沒招了;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="范姜彥豐談粿王「至今未親自道歉」　面對控訴毫不擔憂：他們沒招了" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%8C%83%E5%A7%9C%E5%BD%A5%E8%B1%90%E8%AB%87%E7%B2%BF%E7%8E%8B-%E8%87%B3%E4%BB%8A%E6%9C%AA%E8%A6%AA%E8%87%AA%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89-%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E6%AF%AB%E4%B8%8D%E6%93%94%E6%86%82-%E4%BB%96%E5%80%91%E6%B2%92%E6%8B%9B%E4%BA%86-070112388.html">范姜彥豐談粿王「至今未親自道歉」　面對控訴毫不擔憂：他們沒招了</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">范姜彥豐去年10月指控老婆粿粿（江瑋琳）與王子（邱勝翊）陷入不倫，日前提告侵害配偶權案判決出爐，王子與粿粿需連帶賠償1百萬元。他今（5/2）現身台中勤美誠品出席天后闆妹產品一日店長活動，針對粿粿反控其偷取iPad一事，他表示完全不擔心，「他們可能沒招了，因為這不是事實。」</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E571420A1988DDB6DB239119808029D320AA55BDCFC3F0D205372726F0CD0E4C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnews.com.tw%2F1cd5bbe658f76573003bcaac6af9a0ed"/><img alt="什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/579B8F1F082569D5A9443D49546B91501E3D1C1EEDB0255C032B1108945234B5/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnews.com.tw%2F1cd5bbe658f76573003bcaac6af9a0ed"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;68bce6a3-4b65-3503-a7c2-397129734866&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:15,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:15;ct:story;g:68bce6a3-4b65-3503-a7c2-397129734866;slk:什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%97%87%E7%8B%80%E9%83%BD%E6%B2%92-%E5%B9%B8%E9%81%8B-7%E6%97%AC%E7%BF%81%E5%81%A5%E6%AA%A2-%E9%A0%86%E5%8F%A3-%E5%95%8F-020044723.html">什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">CNEWS匯流新聞網記者陳鈞凱／台北報導 食道癌早期幾乎沒有症狀！70多歲的林先生，菸齡與酒齡長達40年，已經戒菸戒酒的他，日前接受例行健檢，做大腸鏡時，心血來潮，臨時起意加做胃鏡，沒想到竟意外揪出第一期食道癌，手術完整移除病灶，連醫師都直呼真的很幸運！ 林先生回想，年輕時做生意交際應酬，菸酒不離身長達40年，直到10年前顧慮健康才下定決定戒菸戒酒，身體平日...</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">匯流新聞網 ・ 1 天前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EBF370DDC9E06FDE7CEAB0B509DF4F087A53B8493CF3378518F4C311471FD4AA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F7529a75cd76f480836dbc38ef44770b1"/><img alt="不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/28708A892F5E60EF6689ACA5FE90925AA3DB0B125DCBAA93E3F3B187DFF63681/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F7529a75cd76f480836dbc38ef44770b1"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;9c9603bc-ae09-33cd-8272-10388aab96f5&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:16,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:16;ct:story;g:9c9603bc-ae09-33cd-8272-10388aab96f5;slk:不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AA%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E6%9C%89%E9%BB%83%E9%BA%B4%E6%AF%92%E7%B4%A0-%E9%86%AB-%E5%BB%9A%E6%88%BF-%E9%80%993%E7%A8%AE%E8%AA%BF%E5%91%B3%E6%96%99-%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98-062747682.html">不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">黃麴毒素的威脅不僅限於花生製品。林口長庚醫院胃腸肝膽科教授李柏賢在社群平台發文指出，米、堅果、調味料等食品只要保存不當，都可能滋生這種致癌物質，其中最容易被忽略的是辣椒粉、胡椒粉與薑黃粉等辛香調味料。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 2 天前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/92009405340AAFAE72D291B49729FDFE7A09377ADC5BB8A7F284B99B05035607/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fe20289d7e2d0f3a004eea88eec6dc812"/><img alt="林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E17DFC1E4381E01E0F7418DA29556222F689A82E7270E2BAEC51556A499AEC90/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fe20289d7e2d0f3a004eea88eec6dc812"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;7dd3fbf7-d8ab-3dd9-888d-91e3e7dd2678&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:17,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:17;ct:story;g:7dd3fbf7-d8ab-3dd9-888d-91e3e7dd2678;slk:林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9E%97%E4%BE%9D%E6%99%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E7%AA%81%E7%BF%BB%E8%BB%8A-%E4%B8%AD%E7%B6%B2%E6%8F%AD-%E8%A2%AB%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1%E5%85%A7%E5%B9%95-%E5%A4%A7%E7%82%B8%E9%8D%8B-%E4%B8%8D%E8%B2%A0%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB-095748173.html">林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">娛樂中心／綜合報導藝人陳妍希日前才在社群熱情力挺「零負平女神」林依晨於中國主演新片《三心兩意》，沒想到電影原定5月1日上映，卻在開演前不到24小時緊急宣布撤檔，瞬間引爆中國粉絲怒火，不僅粉絲炸鍋痛批「不負責任」，更有網友翻出檔期競爭內幕，質疑影片遭「被消失」真相，並表示這並非出品方第一次如此操作，讓中國影迷相當不滿。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" 