lass="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;4926fa62-31e2-3b75-89d8-71118fc7a488&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:20,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:20;ct:story;g:4926fa62-31e2-3b75-89d8-71118fc7a488;slk:三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F%E7%BD%B7%E5%B7%A5-%E8%A8%82%E5%96%AE%E6%81%90%E6%B5%81%E5%90%91%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3-%E6%9D%8E%E5%9C%A8%E6%98%8E%E6%80%A5%E8%BD%9F1%E5%8F%A5%E6%85%98%E7%BF%BB%E8%BB%8A-%E5%8F%B0%E7%B6%B2%E7%AC%91-%E8%AC%9D%E8%AC%9D-091315513.html">三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">國際中心／綜合報導南韓科技龍頭三星電子爆發史上罕見勞資危機！三星電子工會預告自5月21日起發動長達18天大罷工，引發全球供應鏈關注。南韓總統李在明日前公開提及勞資話題，警告工會勿提出「不當要求」，若只顧自身、提出不當要求，恐會傷害其他工會，甚至遭到國民指責，此發言一出馬上掀起網路批評，此外，三星電子工會預告罷工也被外界分析若供應鏈出現狀況，訂單可能轉向台灣，讓不少台灣網友看了開刷一排：「謝謝～」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>3<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6CB87AC512C5626B27611F8BA3B53A0C772F41E7AFF97D2FFA718CBAAFA91B22/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ff70de4080c1ee52cccb4b3a44ba9d788"/><img alt="香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C9EA044F42881C5655B884F91EAE1E2EC100F9E7B796A6706AC1ECB3DA33E35A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ff70de4080c1ee52cccb4b3a44ba9d788"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;55cc1300-4912-3cd1-bbe3-18c799cdb2fc&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:21,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:21;ct:story;g:55cc1300-4912-3cd1-bbe3-18c799cdb2fc;slk:香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%25　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%99%E8%8F%87%E6%B0%B4%E7%85%AE%E5%A4%AA%E6%B5%AA%E8%B2%BB-%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%B166-%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%8F%AD-1%E7%85%AE%E6%B3%95-%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3-072600655.html">香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">香菇富含膳食纖維，有助於維持腸道健康。營養師老辜指出，不同的烹調方式，影響香菇營養成分的流失程度，其中水煮的流失最多，多醣最高可下降約66%，多酚流失超過一半；最佳煮法是烘烤，抗氧化能力最高，且多酚與類黃酮含量上升。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>3<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/01B5CB4FAA9F46934BA803A8F42810D87B57FFA8E6F7BD9855E5F9AF5A910255/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F0b6c8ccf46d18f0e5915a50db8629257"/><img alt="威力彩頭獎上看3.8億！3生肖財運飆升　有望一夜致富" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/86924CB6130791A28748D40FA9309F9F389359716ADBEA94374BD5688C813150/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F0b6c8ccf46d18f0e5915a50db8629257"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContent