_com_tw_678%2F2419fff89df89d91ff7c3ebca792a82b"/><img alt="一代民歌宗師辭世！晚年飽受大腸癌、阿茲海默症折磨" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C46E10143DBBAFE6DE8B2FF9D9E9A645A74191334B574365AE40A3D9D2ED60F8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F2419fff89df89d91ff7c3ebca792a82b"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;d7713f0e-2ea9-31a8-83f8-4cfd21abd033&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:24,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;一代民歌宗師辭世！晚年飽受大腸癌、阿茲海默症折磨&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:24;ct:story;g:d7713f0e-2ea9-31a8-83f8-4cfd21abd033;slk:一代民歌宗師辭世！晚年飽受大腸癌、阿茲海默症折磨;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="一代民歌宗師辭世！晚年飽受大腸癌、阿茲海默症折磨" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%A3%E6%B0%91%E6%AD%8C%E5%AE%97%E5%B8%AB%E8%BE%AD%E4%B8%96-%E6%99%9A%E5%B9%B4%E9%A3%BD%E5%8F%97%E5%A4%A7%E8%85%B8%E7%99%8C-%E9%98%BF%E8%8C%B2%E6%B5%B7%E9%BB%98%E7%97%87%E6%8A%98%E7%A3%A8-063745187.html">一代民歌宗師辭世！晚年飽受大腸癌、阿茲海默症折磨</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">有「民歌一代宗師」之稱的韓正皓於4月30日中午辭世。家人透過「韓正皓與鍾少蘭的音樂日記」臉書專頁宣布死訊，簡潔地表示：「正皓於4月30日中午辭世！與大家告別啦！」 韓正皓晚年飽受大腸癌與阿茲海默症折磨。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 5 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="cu