o.com/%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E5%BA%9C%E6%AD%A2-%E5%AE%89%E9%BC%A0%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%82-%E7%8B%82%E7%81%91%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0%E8%97%A5-%E9%86%AB%E7%A4%BA%E8%AD%A6%E8%AA%A4%E9%A3%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%A8%E8%BA%AB%E5%87%BA%E8%A1%80%E8%A1%B0%E7%AB%AD-1%E6%97%8F%E7%BE%A4%E6%81%90%E6%B2%92%E5%BE%97%E6%95%91-020100460.html">北市府止「安鼠之亂」狂灑老鼠藥！醫示警誤食害全身出血衰竭...1族群恐沒得救</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">台北市近日鼠患問題越來越嚴重，市議員林亮君砲轟，蔣萬安市府在捷運雙連站旁公園到處放置老鼠藥，一旦小朋友、毛小孩不慎誤食，後果不堪設想。對此，醫師蔡依橙也警告，這樣的做法不僅違法，人類誤食後恐造成全身器官持續出血甚至衰竭，直言「台北市這樣會出事」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">鏡報 ・ 9 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>4<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-4 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FBB4AB4186F6A0FCD375186A333862225DFC50624A8F0FC42E9B738812A36DE0/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2F__647%2F8ed5e93c88571f103449c2d9f3ba44ec"/><img alt="林逸欣父神級精油膏不停賣！「免跑台南」就買得到　購買資訊看這篇" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" s