pan></span></div></div></div><div id=""></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/736D006E44DD0FF6C00C90E5ED442EC7F92B3CBD70AA046D103B6260770E7BFF/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fd29405be303c52114b9a30d48cdeb5cc"/><img alt="法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B5701B9B8D6E1E8305D00A2B06D95E37BF20184B6BFCD20CF651E002DD670D6D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fd29405be303c52114b9a30d48cdeb5cc"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;a73ea9f3-4767-3b75-8704-32a2cb99a526&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:7,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:7;ct:story;g:a73ea9f3-4767-3b75-8704-32a2cb99a526;slk:法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%A0%85%E6%8B%92%E6%94%B6%E6%8A%BC-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E7%A0%B8%E5%BA%97%E5%A5%B3%E6%89%BE%E6%AA%A2%E5%AF%9F%E5%AE%98%E5%A0%B1%E5%88%B0%E6%83%B9%E8%AD%B0-%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-055910775.html">法院堅拒收押！高雄砸店女找檢察官報到惹議「最新裁定出爐」</a></h3><p>即時中心／林韋慈報導高雄一名李姓女子酒後在超商涉嫌暴力毆打女店員，將店員打到頭破血流，遭檢方依傷害罪起訴後，卻因交保一事引發高雄地檢署的不滿。法院數度裁定羈押駁回，雄檢不滿提抗告，最終卻裁定女子要每週找檢察官報到，引起法界譁然。高雄地方法院陳姓法官今（2）日下午裁定李女無需羈押，但調整交保條件，改要求她每週三到法院報到。</p><div><span>民視 ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/36910269B5B04AC1E6997BF012D13204023AF5238216DE9F8835FDADC95C3095/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn_finance_535%2F8b88f98c4faad2cfca973f6dd87a678f"/><img alt="她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/730A80F26FCABF7DA0E5E09824931DABCF335FA2CC90E89A17B1E38EAA3B0854/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn_finance_535%2F8b88f98c4faad2cfca973f6dd87a678f"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;6f617e3d-776b-3336-b7f1-9bf24b7821b5&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:8,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:8;ct:story;g:6f617e3d-776b-3336-b7f1-9bf24b7821b5;slk:她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技" href="https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E5%A5%B9%E5%85%A5%E5%B8%824%E5%B9%B4-40%E8%90%AC%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%91%E8%B3%A0%E5%88%B0%E5%89%A917%E8%90%AC-%E5%85%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9B%9D%E7%BF%BB%E8%BA%AB%E5%AF%86%E6%8A%80-095910090.html">她入市4年「40萬本金賠到剩17萬」！內行曝翻身密技</a></h3><p>財經中心／王妤倢報導近期台積電股價一路狂飆，讓不少投資人笑開懷，但在這波大多頭行情中，卻有人反向慘賠。一名女網友發文哀號，自己接觸股票約3、4年，投入本金40萬元，沒想到如今帳面僅剩約17萬元，整整慘虧23萬元。貼文曝光後，引發大批網友驚呼：「現在大多頭無腦買都能賺，你怎麼有辦法賠23萬？」。</p><div><span>民視財經網 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>2<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FD98955C69EFB6F38055EA96733503EE103F58183B67C1F2F93ABA70AABC2464/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8644fbf53721b9931d0ea584245bbe32"/><img alt="台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E466A1DB8FBDB04667E793C3C6643C911D990494BA7F0E213DC0C2A3E28F9D61/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8644fbf53721b9931d0ea584245bbe32"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;ffb262b0-afd7-373a-b9e4-1cea3a04c3d0&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:9,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:9;ct:story;g:ffb262b0-afd7-373a-b9e4-1cea3a04c3d0;slk:台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E9%BC%A0%E6%82%A3%E7%87%92-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%8A%95%E8%97%A5%E6%89%AF%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E9%81%AD%E6%89%B9-%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E9%81%B8%E4%BD%A0%E5%B9%B9%E5%98%9B-100053130.html">台北鼠患燒！蔣萬安投藥扯中央遭批「市民選你幹嘛」</a></h3><p>即時中心／林韋慈報導台北市近期頻爆鼠患問題，民進黨台北市議員林亮君日前發現市府竟直接將老鼠藥投放在公園，擔心小朋友與寵物誤食。對此，台北市長蔣萬安今（2）日回應表示，環境用藥是中央核可的。台灣基進台北市議員候選人吳欣岱痛批，蔣萬安凡事都要推給中央，「市民選你當市長到底要做什麼？」並呼籲蔣萬安：「把力氣用在真正能解決問題的地方，而不是一直找藉口。」</p><div><span>民視 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>24<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div id=""></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8FFCB0F854DFCB4A9EA9A211C0C6C12958B54A15A7947F0BDEA3E110411A8537/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fudn.com%2Fef0813a53556c976eecff0bd7ed28a04"/><img alt="吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/769EA5E786E5804832E2B64DDED41D6FDC29714226385BAFCB6C2783E3D482B2/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fudn.com%2Fef0813a53556c976eecff0bd7ed28a04"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;77cefb6f-9479-33ac-91cf-2228c130384e&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:11,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:11;ct:story;g:77cefb6f-9479-33ac-91cf-2228c130384e;slk:吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%90%9E85%E9%A1%86%E6%AF%92%E8%86%A0%E5%9B%8A%E9%97%96%E9%97%9C-%E5%8C%88%E7%89%99%E5%88%A9%E7%94%B7%E7%82%BA%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E7%BE%8E%E9%87%91%E7%95%B6%E4%BA%BA%E9%AB%94%E9%81%8B%E6%AF%92%E6%A9%9F-053732386.html">吞85顆毒膠囊闖關 匈牙利男為萬元美金當人體運毒機</a></h3><p>高雄小港機場查獲一名匈牙利籍男子為賺取約1萬美元報酬，鋌而走險擔任「人體運毒機」，在柬埔寨吞下高達85顆海洛因膠囊後，搭機闖關，檢警在他體內起出大量毒品，高雄地院審結，考量該男僅為運毒集團底層，且毒品未流入市面，雖運輸一級毒品面臨死刑或無期徒刑重罪，法官兩次減刑後，輕判其有期徒刑8年6月，執行完畢驅逐出境。</p><div><span>聯合新聞網 ・ 6 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>12<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F7D24E81383ADADB261DCD0FD5EAA95FEF72D84079DB1DC57ADF9D165C7AAFAC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F4b3881c34e0b20cdefc99009d2b2a359"/><img alt="香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4FF34AA6E34A5BC90ED6863CCE8810C45F260D5C4A04F1D19D66B14C5E407C45/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F4b3881c34e0b20cdefc99009d2b2a359"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;99ee4631-d68b-3ebc-a9a8-c47215334884&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:12,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:12;ct:story;g:99ee4631-d68b-3ebc-a9a8-c47215334884;slk:香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%99%E8%8F%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%85%AE%E6%89%8D%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7-%E9%80%99%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-%E6%9C%80%E5%82%B7-%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E7%B4%A0%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%89-%E5%8D%8A-090141087.html">香菇怎麼煮才健康？「這方式」最傷！營養素直接掉一半</a></h3><p>香菇含有豐富的膳食纖維與香菇嘌呤等營養成分，具有代謝調節作用。不過烹調方式的選擇將大幅影響其營養價值。營養師老辜在臉書粉專分析4種常見烹調方式，其中水煮對香菇營養的破壞最為嚴重，多醣含量最高可下降約66％，多酚流失也可能超過一半，而烘烤則能最大化香菇的抗氧化能力。</p><div><span>中天新聞網 ・ 3 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3FA0317FEDF3F3CDE2308B0E3DEDB6C813B2D4DECF7A98B6F6C95D41C50EA096/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F37e36492d8e0c93c6ef4ca98b7cb3c18"/><img alt="45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6676B4840A8F492F64AB31FBE8DE34584D2FB07952EC16A771169A7EE063D9A7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F37e36492d8e0c93c6ef4ca98b7cb3c18"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;c32f64ad-cf1e-35fe-a38b-3a7e3e6a040a&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:13,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:13;ct:story;g:c32f64ad-cf1e-35fe-a38b-3a7e3e6a040a;slk:45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/45%E6%AD%B2%E7%AB%B9%E7%A7%91%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%AB%E8%A1%80%E4%BE%BF%E6%98%8F%E5%80%92%EF%BC%81%E7%AB%9F%E7%BD%B9%E9%A3%9F%E9%81%93%E7%99%8C-%E9%86%AB%E6%8F%AD%E4%BA%9E%E6%B4%B2%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%8C1%E9%AB%94%E8%B3%AA%E3%80%8D%E6%98%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%8B%9B-030800757.html">45歲竹科工程師血便昏倒！竟罹食道癌 醫揭亞洲人「1體質」易中招</a></h3><p>酒精是食道癌的重要風險因子之一，亞洲人更需提高警覺。胸腔外科醫師謝義山分享，一名45歲竹科工程師因出現大量血便而送醫，檢查確診為食道癌。醫師提醒，亞洲族群常見酒精代謝基因缺陷，飲酒易增加罹患食道癌的風險，因此除了應適量飲酒外，更應定期做健檢。</p><div><span>三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 8 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>5<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div id=""></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/35D79BD80E7211EDC8AD09499E7D8D0A55A10E0BDEA075DC3F335D9A8F09293E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnews.com.tw%2F1cd5bbe658f76573003bcaac6af9a0ed"/><img alt="什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F5B12BA5ECA3FA1982798A02C6072F1565A96D0F8D45DA5C0B88132C9DDD6D97/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnews.com.tw%2F1cd5bbe658f76573003bcaac6af9a0ed"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;68bce6a3-4b65-3503-a7c2-397129734866&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:15,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:15;ct:story;g:68bce6a3-4b65-3503-a7c2-397129734866;slk:什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%97%87%E7%8B%80%E9%83%BD%E6%B2%92-%E5%B9%B8%E9%81%8B-7%E6%97%AC%E7%BF%81%E5%81%A5%E6%AA%A2-%E9%A0%86%E5%8F%A3-%E5%95%8F-020044723.html">什麼症狀都沒   幸運！7旬翁健檢「順口一問」竟揪食道癌</a></h3><p>CNEWS匯流新聞網記者陳鈞凱／台北報導 食道癌早期幾乎沒有症狀！70多歲的林先生，菸齡與酒齡長達40年，已經戒菸戒酒的他，日前接受例行健檢，做大腸鏡時，心血來潮，臨時起意加做胃鏡，沒想到竟意外揪出第一期食道癌，手術完整移除病灶，連醫師都直呼真的很幸運！ 林先生回想，年輕時做生意交際應酬，菸酒不離身長達40年，直到10年前顧慮健康才下定決定戒菸戒酒，身體平日...</p><div><span>匯流新聞網 ・ 1 天前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EBF370DDC9E06FDE7CEAB0B509DF4F087A53B8493CF3378518F4C311471FD4AA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F7529a75cd76f480836dbc38ef44770b1"/><img alt="不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/28708A892F5E60EF6689ACA5FE90925AA3DB0B125DCBAA93E3F3B187DFF63681/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F7529a75cd76f480836dbc38ef44770b1"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;9c9603bc-ae09-33cd-8272-10388aab96f5&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:16,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:16;ct:story;g:9c9603bc-ae09-33cd-8272-10388aab96f5;slk:不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AA%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E6%9C%89%E9%BB%83%E9%BA%B4%E6%AF%92%E7%B4%A0-%E9%86%AB-%E5%BB%9A%E6%88%BF-%E9%80%993%E7%A8%AE%E8%AA%BF%E5%91%B3%E6%96%99-%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98-062747682.html">不只花生有黃麴毒素！　醫：廚房「這3種調味料」風險最高</a></h3><p>黃麴毒素的威脅不僅限於花生製品。林口長庚醫院胃腸肝膽科教授李柏賢在社群平台發文指出，米、堅果、調味料等食品只要保存不當，都可能滋生這種致癌物質，其中最容易被忽略的是辣椒粉、胡椒粉與薑黃粉等辛香調味料。</p><div><span>中天新聞網 ・ 2 天前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6968A0142662A7FF297889090A59732A791DD92D9108772885DD381E1FD9874D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F8f046db11ab4f983f9d23983a061f1f3"/><img alt="《TA們說》網紅LOHO驚傳過世　親友證實粉絲淚崩" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CDE8CDDBA0C01DB0C40F572F3F0969D7F9904F14321E50F08964C6A3D5BA4FF5/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F8f046db11ab4f983f9d23983a061f1f3"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;1c17285e-34af-3c02-a1fd-513999c12c84&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:17,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;《TA們說》網紅LOHO驚傳過世　親友證實粉絲淚崩&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:17;ct:story;g:1c17285e-34af-3c02-a1fd-513999c12c84;slk:《TA們說》網紅LOHO驚傳過世　親友證實粉絲淚崩;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="《TA們說》網紅LOHO驚傳過世　親友證實粉絲淚崩" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/ta%E5%80%91%E8%AA%AA-%E7%B6%B2%E7%B4%85loho%E9%A9%9A%E5%82%B3%E9%81%8E%E4%B8%96-%E8%A6%AA%E5%8F%8B%E8%AD%89%E5%AF%A6%E7%B2%89%E7%B5%B2%E6%B7%9A%E5%B4%A9-102724532.html">《TA們說》網紅LOHO驚傳過世　親友證實粉絲淚崩</a></h3><p>網紅LOHO近日因不幸過世，親友透過社群平台Instagram證實此一訊息，消息傳出後引發大批粉絲震驚與哀悼。目前尚未對外公開具體過世原因。</p><div><span>中天新聞網 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div id=""></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/92009405340AAFAE72D291B49729FDFE7A09377ADC5BB8A7F284B99B05035607/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fe20289d7e2d0f3a004eea88eec6dc812"/><img alt="林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E17DFC1E4381E01E0F7418DA29556222F689A82E7270E2BAEC51556A499AEC90/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fe20289d7e2d0f3a004eea88eec6dc812"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;7dd3fbf7-d8ab-3dd9-888d-91e3e7dd2678&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:19,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:19;ct:story;g:7dd3fbf7-d8ab-3dd9-888d-91e3e7dd2678;slk:林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9E%97%E4%BE%9D%E6%99%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E7%AA%81%E7%BF%BB%E8%BB%8A-%E4%B8%AD%E7%B6%B2%E6%8F%AD-%E8%A2%AB%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1%E5%85%A7%E5%B9%95-%E5%A4%A7%E7%82%B8%E9%8D%8B-%E4%B8%8D%E8%B2%A0%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB-095748173.html">林依晨中國發展突翻車！中網揭「被消失內幕」大炸鍋：不負責任</a></h3><p>娛樂中心／綜合報導藝人陳妍希日前才在社群熱情力挺「零負平女神」林依晨於中國主演新片《三心兩意》，沒想到電影原定5月1日上映，卻在開演前不到24小時緊急宣布撤檔，瞬間引爆中國粉絲怒火，不僅粉絲炸鍋痛批「不負責任」，更有網友翻出檔期競爭內幕，質疑影片遭「被消失」真相，並表示這並非出品方第一次如此操作，讓中國影迷相當不滿。</p><div><span>民視 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>1<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6CB87AC512C5626B27611F8BA3B53A0C772F41E7AFF97D2FFA718CBAAFA91B22/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ff70de4080c1ee52cccb4b3a44ba9d788"/><img alt="香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C9EA044F42881C5655B884F91EAE1E2EC100F9E7B796A6706AC1ECB3DA33E35A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ff70de4080c1ee52cccb4b3a44ba9d788"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;55cc1300-4912-3cd1-bbe3-18c799cdb2fc&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:20,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:20;ct:story;g:55cc1300-4912-3cd1-bbe3-18c799cdb2fc;slk:香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%25　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%99%E8%8F%87%E6%B0%B4%E7%85%AE%E5%A4%AA%E6%B5%AA%E8%B2%BB-%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%B166-%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%8F%AD-1%E7%85%AE%E6%B3%95-%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3-072600655.html">香菇水煮太浪費！營養流失66%　研究揭「1煮法」最佳：多酚不減反增</a></h3><p>香菇富含膳食纖維，有助於維持腸道健康。營養師老辜指出，不同的烹調方式，影響香菇營養成分的流失程度，其中水煮的流失最多，多醣最高可下降約66%，多酚流失超過一半；最佳煮法是烘烤，抗氧化能力最高，且多酚與類黃酮含量上升。</p><div><span>三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>3<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0195E12D9855B3820E35C983ED962E8DA53A5296A9AF7CA55956C9A3EFDAEA22/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F21cd2ce21ecfc014785c211b898f5ffe"/><img alt="三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CCE909195902AD17F611E66022423553932114979525149BE17C478DF7834C3D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F21cd2ce21ecfc014785c211b898f5ffe"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;4926fa62-31e2-3b75-89d8-71118fc7a488&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:21,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:21;ct:story;g:4926fa62-31e2-3b75-89d8-71118fc7a488;slk:三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F%E7%BD%B7%E5%B7%A5-%E8%A8%82%E5%96%AE%E6%81%90%E6%B5%81%E5%90%91%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3-%E6%9D%8E%E5%9C%A8%E6%98%8E%E6%80%A5%E8%BD%9F1%E5%8F%A5%E6%85%98%E7%BF%BB%E8%BB%8A-%E5%8F%B0%E7%B6%B2%E7%AC%91-%E8%AC%9D%E8%AC%9D-091315513.html">三星罷工「訂單恐流向台灣」！李在明急轟1句慘翻車…台網笑：謝謝</a></h3><p>國際中心／綜合報導南韓科技龍頭三星電子爆發史上罕見勞資危機！三星電子工會預告自5月21日起發動長達18天大罷工，引發全球供應鏈關注。南韓總統李在明日前公開提及勞資話題，警告工會勿提出「不當要求」，若只顧自身、提出不當要求，恐會傷害其他工會，甚至遭到國民指責，此發言一出馬上掀起網路批評，此外，三星電子工會預告罷工也被外界分析若供應鏈出現狀況，訂單可能轉向台灣，讓不少台灣網友看了開刷一排：「謝謝～」。</p><div><span>民視 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>3<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div id=""></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/01B5CB4FAA9F46934BA803A8F42810D87B57FFA8E6F7BD9855E5F9AF5A910255/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F0b6c8ccf46d18f0e5915a50db8629257"/><img alt="威力彩頭獎上看3.8億！3生肖財運飆升　有望一夜致富" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/86924CB6130791A28748D40FA9309F9F389359716ADBEA94374BD5688C813150/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F0b6c8ccf46d18f0e5915a50db8629257"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;576f29ee-19d7-357b-afea-20264e37a3be&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:23,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;威力彩頭獎上看3.8億！3生肖財運飆升　有望一夜致富&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:23;ct:story;g:576f29ee-19d7-357b-afea-20264e37a3be;slk:威力彩頭獎上看3.8億！3生肖財運飆升　有望一夜致富;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="威力彩頭獎上看3.8億！3生肖財運飆升　有望一夜致富" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A8%81%E5%8A%9B%E5%BD%A9%E9%A0%AD%E7%8D%8E%E4%B8%8A%E7%9C%8B3-8%E5%84%84-3%E7%94%9F%E8%82%96%E8%B2%A1%E9%81%8B%E9%A3%86%E5%8D%87-%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B-%E5%A4%9C%E8%87%B4%E5%AF%8C-080403331.html">威力彩頭獎上看3.8億！3生肖財運飆升　有望一夜致富</a></h3><p>威力彩5/4晚間開獎，頭獎上看3.8億元。《搜狐網》運勢專欄點名生肖龍、猴、牛的人在這段期間將受到財神爺眷顧，不僅正財有望提升，就連偏財運也相當不錯，錢包越來越鼓。</p><div><span>中天新聞網 ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B4CB59C6D2F5787749895CA4B2BC4E84DAB99D8151C2D1D135D39DA55DD15013/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrordaily_390%2Fc0d22abe72944c7717b489c4dddc26a7"/><img alt="北市府止「安鼠之亂」狂灑老鼠藥！醫示警誤食害全身出血衰竭...1族群恐沒得救" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1C047A3696C6CE18D1E258A498323F17212E56F26C7557D63F87D7BD821DCED8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrordaily_390%2Fc0d22abe72944c7717b489c4dddc26a7"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;f10a79ad-cf8c-3144-a802-eaf584d623c7&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:24,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;北市府止「安鼠之亂」狂灑老鼠藥！醫示警誤食害全身出血衰竭...1族群恐沒得救&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:24;ct:story;g:f10a79ad-cf8c-3144-a802-eaf584d623c7;slk:北市府止「安鼠之亂」狂灑老鼠藥！醫示警誤食害全身出血衰竭...1族群恐沒得救;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="北市府止「安鼠之亂」狂灑老鼠藥！醫示警誤食害全身出血衰竭...1族群恐沒得救" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E5%BA%9C%E6%AD%A2-%E5%AE%89%E9%BC%A0%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%82-%E7%8B%82%E7%81%91%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0%E8%97%A5-%E9%86%AB%E7%A4%BA%E8%AD%A6%E8%AA%A4%E9%A3%9F%E5%AE%B3%E5%85%A8%E8%BA%AB%E5%87%BA%E8%A1%80%E8%A1%B0%E7%AB%AD-1%E6%97%8F%E7%BE%A4%E6%81%90%E6%B2%92%E5%BE%97%E6%95%91-020100460.html">北市府止「安鼠之亂」狂灑老鼠藥！醫示警誤食害全身出血衰竭...1族群恐沒得救</a></h3><p>台北市近日鼠患問題越來越嚴重，市議員林亮君砲轟，蔣萬安市府在捷運雙連站旁公園到處放置老鼠藥，一旦小朋友、毛小孩不慎誤食，後果不堪設想。對此，醫師蔡依橙也警告，這樣的做法不僅違法，人類誤食後恐造成全身器官持續出血甚至衰竭，直言「台北市這樣會出事」。</p><div><span>鏡報 ・ 10 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>4<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/164048C678B37BB638DCAA907E924056D732E8B57A703A1545E1E34B4827ABE6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F6733a293b0c47d68837c388136d20ce5"/><img alt="72歲陳盈潔病況曝！許常德拋重話：也許是最後告別" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0CC4531AFB72ED0C23AA13AE68FDDA5A97AF8E7C94AD7440EF4D744FABDCA964/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F6733a293b0c47d68837c388136d20ce5"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;5c6261d2-829c-320f-a6a7-d367a3f70d0f&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:25,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;72歲陳盈潔病況曝！許常德拋重話：也許是最後告別&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:25;ct:story;g:5c6261d2-829c-320f-a6a7-d367a3f70d0f;slk:72歲陳盈潔病況曝！許常德拋重話：也許是最後告別;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="72歲陳盈潔病況曝！許常德拋重話：也許是最後告別" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/72%E6%AD%B2%E9%99%B3%E7%9B%88%E6%BD%94%E7%97%85%E6%B3%81%E6%9B%9D-%E8%A8%B1%E5%B8%B8%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%8B%E9%87%8D%E8%A9%B1-%E4%B9%9F%E8%A8%B1%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%80%E5%BE%8C%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5-075701335.html">72歲陳盈潔病況曝！許常德拋重話：也許是最後告別</a></h3><p>娛樂中心／王妤倢報導現年72歲的資深台語歌后陳盈潔，過去因教唆偽造有價證券罪遭判刑3年2月，並於2023年入獄服刑。怎料入獄後健康狀況頻亮紅燈，陸續爆出急性腎衰竭、敗血症，甚至一度誤傳死訊。而音樂人許常德經常對外報告陳盈潔的身體狀況，今（2）日突發文預告，晚點將報告她的近況，更拋下重言表示：「也許就是最後告別了」，引發外界關注與憂心。</p><div><span>民視 ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div id=""></div><div><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/265757114613780156D13B67BEA75DEF790A9CB7E08B7D7CA53926A1D68C0A25/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F96019d8eee824b97c6da29d2f4a0189b"/><img alt="每天3億人流動！中國五一長假塞爆　高速公路現外送奇景" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/134492FBF97F30C1E9B0BE5BB5DAD723113D2EC0C7B6BE5A4611026C32E2273C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F96019d8eee824b97c6da29d2f4a0189b"/></picture><div><h3><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;4a7d50a9-5ba2-382e-82db-5d528e2d7395&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:27,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;每天3億人流動！中國五一長假塞爆　高速公路現外送奇景&#34;,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;ySubModuleName&#34;:&#34;strm-1&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:27;ct:story;g:4a7d50a9-5ba2-382e-82db-5d528e2d7395;slk:每天3億人流動！中國五一長假塞爆　高速公路現外送奇景;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="每天3億人流動！中國五一長假塞爆　高速公路現外送奇景" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A93%E5%84%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%B5%81%E5%8B%95-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E4%BA%94-%E9%95%B7%E5%81%87%E5%A1%9E%E7%88%86-%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%85%AC%E8%B7%AF%E7%8F%BE%E5%A4%96%E9%80%81%E5%A5%87%E6%99%AF-070031352.html">每天3億人流動！中國五一長假塞爆　高速公路現外送奇景</a></h3><p>中國自昨日（5/1）起開始連放5天勞動節長假，預計平均每天會有3億人次流動。許多民眾開車出門遊玩卻受困高速公路，動彈不得又飢腸轆轆下，只好點外送解飢。此外，各大景區則是呼籲遊客行前查詢預約狀況，免得受困人群卻又無法入場。</p><div><span>太報 ・ 5 小時前</span> ・ <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.575 4.3a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0 12.55h2.85a6.275 6.275 0 1 0 0-12.55zM2.5 10.575A8.075 8.075 0 0 1 10.575 2.5h2.85a8.075 8.075 0 1 1 0 16.15h-2.283c-1.244 1.063-2.806 2.372-3.792 3.1v-3.77a8.08 8.08 0 0 1-4.85-7.405"></path></svg>7<span>則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div><div id="stream-loadmore-placeholder"></div></div></div></div></section></div></main><div><div><aside><div id="sda-top-right-iframe">\n        <div>\n          廣告\n        </div>\n      </div><section id="module-most-popular"><div id="trending"><div><div></div><h2>熱門新聞</h2></div><ul><li><a data-yga="{&#34;yContentType&#34;:&#34;story&#34;,&#34;yDestinationContentUUID&#34;:&#34;f8ccec9c-3a38-324e-989f-ed3b4c206123&#34;,&#34;yInteractivityType&#34;:0,&#34;yLinkElement&#34;:&#34;hdln&#34;,&#34;yLinkPosition&#34;:1,&#34;yLinkText&#34;:&#34;缺醫風暴2》當待遇不如台積電工程師  年輕醫師出走狂潮來襲&#34;}" data-ylk="cpos:1;ct:story;elm:hdln;g:f8ccec9c-3a38-324e-989f-ed3b4c206123;itc:0;pos:1;sec:trending;slk:缺醫風暴2》當待遇不如台積電工程師  年輕醫師出走狂潮來襲;" aria-label="缺醫風暴2》當待遇不如台積電工程師  年輕醫師出走狂潮來襲" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BC%BA%E9%86%AB%E9%A2%A8%E6%9A%B42-%E7%95%B6%E5%BE%85%E9%81%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%A6%82%E5%8F%B0%E7%A9%8D%E9%9B%BB%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%AB-%E5%B9%B4%E8%BC%95%E9%86%AB%E5%B8%AB%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%B0%E7%8B%82%E6%BD%AE%E4%BE%86%E8%A5%B2-173958818.html"><div><div>1</div></div><h3>缺醫風暴2》當待遇不如台積電工程師  年輕醫師出走狂潮來襲</h3></a></li><li><a data