113	使用於城市規劃、社會政策制定及人口統計分析，臺北市年齡分區數據可協助市府機關與研究單位掌握市內人口結構的變化。此指標適用於評估各年齡層在不同行政區的分布情形，有助於規劃教育資源、醫療設施及長照服務的佈局與優化。此外，企業亦可依據此資料進行在地市場分析，針對不同年齡族群設計產品與服務，提升區域經營策略的精準度與實效性，強化對臺北市多元人口需求的回應。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n	en	Used in urban planning, social policy formulation, and population statistical analysis, Taipei City's age distribution data can help government agencies and research units grasp the changing population structure within the city. This indicator is applicable to evaluating the distribution of different age groups in various administrative districts, facilitating the planning and optimization of educational resources, medical facilities, and long-term care services. Additionally, businesses can use this data to conduct local market analysis, designing products and services tailored to different age groups, thereby enhancing the accuracy and effectiveness of regional business strategies and strengthening responses to the diverse needs of Taipei City's population.	use_case	2026-05-02 10:48:13.056184+00
114	顯示臺北市年齡分區，將市民人口依年齡群體劃分至不同行政區域。此分區有助於掌握各區人口結構分布，包括幼年人口、青壯年人口與高齡人口比例，為政策制定者、城市規劃單位及研究人員提供重要的分析依據。透過此資料，可進行公共資源配置、社區照護設計及設施規劃，確保臺北市在教育、醫療、交通與長照等方面的發展，能更貼近各年齡層居民的實際需求，促進人口結構與城市功能的平衡發展。	en	The display of Taipei City's age division, divides the population into different administrative regions according to age groups. This division helps to grasp the population structure distribution of each district, including the proportion of young, middle-aged and elderly populations, providing important analytical basis for policymakers, urban planning units and researchers. Through this data, public resource allocation, community care design and facility planning can be carried out, ensuring that Taipei City's development in education, medical care, transportation and long-term care is closer to the actual needs of residents of all age groups, promoting balanced development of population structure and urban function.	long_desc	2026-05-02 10:48:13.13435+00
